{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32553","headline":"弃妇 · 刘驾","name":"弃妇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"回车在门前，欲上心更悲。\n路傍见花发，似妾初嫁时。\n养蚕已成茧，织素犹在机。\n新人应笑此，何如画蛾眉。\n昨日惜红颜，今日畏老迟。\n良媒去不远，此恨今告谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32553.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32553","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}